<title>PERU: Peru's Gloria to build plant in Lima.</title>
<headline>Peru's Gloria to build plant in Lima.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's leading milk producer, Gloria SA, plans to invest $20 million to build a new production plant and distribution center in Lima, the Lima Stock Exchange said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The exchange's daily report did not say in what time-frame Gloria intended to build the new facilities.</p>
<p>The company currently has one plant in the southern city of Arequipa, from where it transports milk to Lima.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
